LC-06   MEM07-F05      GameWorld Teardown Without Reallocations or Token Resurrection   [PASS]    
   -> Observed: PASS: GameWorld destroyed cleanly; cancel token stayed true; zero component reallocations during teardown
   -> Details:  Verified cancel token persistence, context pointer clearing, and Teardown/Clear separation.

LC-07   MEM07-F06      Aligned Allocator Fallback and Sized Delete Pairing              [PASS]    
   -> Observed: PASS: Over-aligned types (16/32/64/128), small alignments and sized delete executed without CRT heap corruption
   -> Details:  MSVC _aligned_malloc and _aligned_free paired cleanly across all alignment sizes.

LC-08   MEM07-F07      StateManager Initialization Failure Rollback and ReplaceState Safety[PASS]    
   -> Observed: PASS: PushState failure rolls back and resumes underlying state; ReplaceState discards failed state; null states handled gracefully
   -> Details:  Full StateManager transition error recovery validated for Push, Replace, Change and null guards.


